'data-edge'))\n      tip.style.display='none';\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</div></div>\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\n:::\n\n[Graph generators](../user-guide/generators.qmd#bipartite-models) compares the random\nbipartite models.\n\n",
